      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Paradoxical bronchospasm may be life-threatening and often appears with first use of a new canister; stop the product and use an alternative if breathing acutely worsens after inhalation. Increasing dose frequency, reduced duration of relief, nighttime symptoms, or failure to respond can indicate deteriorating asthma or COPD. Excessive systemic beta stimulation can cause tachyarrhythmia, ischemia, hypokalemia, hyperglycemia, or lactic acidosis."),
