      aliases: ["Serevent", "Serevent Diskus", "salmeterol xinafoate", "slow onset LABA", "salmeteral"],
      brandExamples: ["Serevent Diskus"],
      class: "Approximately 12-hour long-acting beta2-adrenergic agonist (LABA) with a slower onset than formoterol",
