      interactions: ["Other LABAs, sympathomimetics, MAO inhibitors, tricyclics, and QT-prolonging drugs add cardiovascular risk.", "Nonselective beta blockers oppose bronchodilation; non-potassium-sparing diuretics can magnify hypokalemia."],
